This crate (`symphonia-codec-atrac9`) is a from-scratch, pure-Rust ATRAC9 decoder. It is
licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project Symphonia.

ATRAC9 has no public specification. The bitstream parser, the canonical Huffman codebook
descriptors and all other tables (`src/tables.rs`), the band extension, the intensity stereo,
the IMDCT windowing and the noise generator (`src/noise.rs`, FFmpeg's `libavutil/lfg.c`) follow
FFmpeg's `libavcodec/atrac9dec.c`, `libavcodec/atrac9tab.h` and `libavutil/lfg.c`, which are
distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later.

